        "Different genetic mutations (COL1A1, COL1A2)",
        "Variable presence of blue sclerae and dentinogenesis imperfecta"
      ]
    },
    {
      "diseaseId": "arthrogryposis-multiplex-congenita",
      "distinguishingFeatures": [
        "Lack of bone fragility and fractures",
        "No collagen synthesis defects",
        "Different genetic causes and inheritance patterns"
      ]
    }
  ],
